comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T13:08:39.685Z","harness:codex","Conformance evidence: replaced the tag-only property with whole serialized document comparisons over fixed branch snapshots, original/reversed/rotated fold orders and swapped merge directions. Independent scalar/body oracles cover preferred-side, stable-value, and latest-document policies. Two actual temporary source mutations (dropping other-side union contributions and forcing preferred-side scalar selection) both failed the new suite; original source restored. Field-class inventories and typed policy map require explicit conformance updates. Additional generated disjoint edits and optional-field deletion preserve full expected documents."
  "2026-09-11T13:39:19.383Z","harness:codex","Complete-document conformance and project-boundary linked tests passed through pm test. The generated cases preserve fixed branch snapshots across permutations, test both merge directions, use independent retained-value oracles, and cover scalar deletion and disjoint body edits. Source mutation controls dropping incoming union entries or forcing preferred-side scalars both fail the conformance suite. Arbitrary per-field causality is explicitly outside the existing timestamp policy contract."
  "2026-09-11T13:45:15.235Z","harness:codex","Integrated verification: all 673 test files and 8723 tests pass. Exact source coverage is statements 64265/64265, branches 48935/48935, functions 13350/13350, lines 61566/61566 (100/100/100/100, zero uncovered). ESLint and all three duplicate scans passed; repository static assurance, generated contracts, package boundaries, command grammar, refusal closure, token budgets, tracker-context measurements and gate registry passed. All ten SDK import-cost and six CLI transport-floor checks pass after coverage load settled. Temporary real Git identity acceptance, package-first dogfood, packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx and installed published 2026.9.11 npm/Bun sessions passed. The initial npm tarball install timed out; the normal smoke retried with cache preference and passed. Credential scan and dependency advisory census found zero secrets/vulnerabilities. Hosted review and merge remain pending."
  "2026-09-11T13:45:54.659Z","harness:codex","Final local closeout: graph-composition and record-integrity assurance passed; final TypeScript and focused ESLint passed. Structured closure records implemented and locally verified behavior for review, not a claim of merge or publication."
  "2026-09-11T14:22:30.489Z","harness:codex","PR 1237 CodeRabbit finding accepted: the N-branch expected document previously reused the fold, so deterministic retention loss could remain invisible. The oracle now constructs every generated scalar, body, tag union and maximum timestamp directly from input values and policy. A source mutation control will verify deterministic description loss is detected."
  "2026-09-11T14:24:29.892Z","harness:codex","Independent-oracle negative control passed: temporarily replacing merged.description with the ancestor description made the N-branch property fail immediately. The source was restored exactly afterward. Shared-ancestor history fuzz fixtures now provide their actual first creation event instead of an empty ancestor."
  "2026-09-11T14:43:46.856Z","harness:codex","Review round verification passed: complete pnpm quality:static; all 673 files and 8724 tests; exact coverage statements 64264/64264, branches 48937/48937, functions 13349/13349, lines 61565/61565. Refreshed PM-linked tests and disposable real Git/CLI acceptance passed. SDK and history-driver empty-ancestor identity regressions now reject identical creates; independent N-branch document oracle detects a real deterministic description-loss source mutant. Awaiting pushed-head CI and fresh bot review."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T13:41:57.241Z","harness:codex","Convergence tests must keep each branch snapshot fixed across permutations. Reassigning timestamps by fold position compares different histories and can hide directional behavior. Compare complete serialized documents and verify retained values with an independent oracle, not only sorted tags."
